# DESK30, cold start: boot the card the d30 run saved (its NEWDESK.INF now
# carries `#X 02 09 06 FF   C:\QED.NAP@ QED.NAP@`) and photograph the desktop.
# The shortcut must be back, at the same grid cell, with the same label.
# Built with probe_patch.py so the icon's exact hit point lands in the serial
# log for the d30c run.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_BOOT
2000 mark B_END
